    {
        "content": "<p>Hmm, indeed, when I try</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">git</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">checkout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">master</span>\n<span class=\"n\">git</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pull</span>\n<span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">get</span>\n<span class=\"n\">lake</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">build</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">--no-build</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I get some cache misses:</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>output</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>jon@computer<span class=\"w\"> </span>mathlib<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span>master<span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>»<span class=\"w\"> </span>lake<span class=\"w\"> </span>build<span class=\"w\"> </span>--no-build\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">1</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>Mathlib.Tactic.Linter.DirectoryDependency\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">15</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>Batteries.Tactic.Lint.Basic\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">18</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>Batteries.Tactic.Unreachable\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">33</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>ImportGraph.Imports.ImportGraph\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">35</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>ImportGraph.Lean.Environment\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">38</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>Batteries.Lean.Meta.Inaccessible\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n✖<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">42</span>/329<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Building<span class=\"w\"> </span>Batteries.Tactic.OpenPrivate\nerror:<span class=\"w\"> </span>target<span class=\"w\"> </span>is<span class=\"w\"> </span>out-of-date<span class=\"w\"> </span>and<span class=\"w\"> </span>needs<span class=\"w\"> </span>to<span class=\"w\"> </span>be<span class=\"w\"> </span>rebuilt\n...\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>and <code>lake exe cache get!</code> then loads everything correctly. Looking into it <span aria-label=\"eyes\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f440\" role=\"img\" title=\"eyes\">:eyes:</span></p>",
